	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"I've known Mr. Tepes for 3 years now, and as time has passed, I must admit he's grown on me. Recently, he told me something important. He's a &4&ovampire&r. I had heard the tales, but never have I seen one so up close. Though I initially came to him in search of medicine, &otrue&r medicine, I cannot act as if I am not curious about this vampirism. I hope to learn more as time passes."
				"- Lisa"
			]
			id: "7DE3140D7B00471E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "323928D3EF80E528"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "eternalcurrencies:currency_item"
					tag: {
						currencies: [{
							amount: 100L
							currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
						}]
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "6DB30DA03A94C842"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "guideapi_vp:vampirism-guidebook"
					tag: {
						G-API_Category_Page: 0
						G-API_Page: 1
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "A Journey of Knowledge"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The potion effect &o&4\"Sanguinare Vampiris\"&r is what converts you. &oSaid effect comes from the fangs of a vampire, either from being attacked by one, or by using their dropped fangs on yourself.&r &o&4If not cured, the effect's duration reaching 0, will turn you.&r"
				"Being a vampire seems to have some nice advantages. It seems &o&4most undead will ignore you unless attacked&r. You no longer need to breathe underwater, but it weakens you."
			]
			id: "7211E9ED86A677EE"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2BCEAD583FA495A2"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "eternalcurrencies:currency_item"
