		{
			dependencies: ["5635D89E2594043D"]
			description: [
				"When you level up as a vampire, you gain skill points that are used to gain various perks. It must be know, though, that you will not be able to obtain each and every one."
				"In addition, as you grow stronger, so does your weakness to the sun. At level 2, it will weaken you; at level 3, you will grow nauseus; and at any levels above, you will take damage."
