		{
			dependencies: ["7D797EC1976FD2E0"]
			description: [
				"As a vampire, you won't die immediately. Instead, when taking fatal damage, you will enter a Downed state. Waiting long enough, you will be able to resurrect yourself, and your blood bar will be converted to health. Afterwards, you will receive a potion effect, during which you cannot revive."
				"YOu can still be killed outright by fire and holy water, and vampire hunters often carry stakes to finish you off."
